
# Driver Performance Engineer

Python project for evidence-based analysis of driver performance using telemetry generated by EA SPORTS F1 25.

## Goals

- Analyze driving performance using telemetry and metrics.
- Compare laps and identify where performance differences occur.
- Separate measured observations from possible diagnoses.
- Produce recommendations supported by available evidence.

## Architecture

This project reuses the `f1-telemetry-analyzer` package from Project 02.

## Status

Phase 0: initial project setup and dependency integration.

No driver-performance analysis features have been implemented yet.
